            <h3 class="tit mt100">2025 윈터스쿨 <strong>모집요강 및 지원혜택</strong></h3>

            <div class="tab-cont-wrap mozip">
                <div class="bt-tab type02 mb30">
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="on">2월 윈터스쿨 PLUS</a>
